{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>ויצא.</b> There are words in the holy language that are equivalent in meaning, and they are from two binyanim, the light and the heavy, such as ויעתר אל ד׳ and העתרתי אל ד׳ (Exodus 8:25), and similarly אשר אנכי מורה (1 Samuel 20:36), and הוא ירה החצי (ibid.), and these words that are like this are few in number:"], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:32:46.541265520Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}